1
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,100
[The content, events, techniques, and outcomes of massage depicted in this series]

2
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:08,211
[are entirely fictional and intended for entertainment purposes only.]

3
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,421
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference for traditional Thai massage.]

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,901
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate any of the techniques shown,]

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,001
[as doing so may result in injury.]

6
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:13,161
[Massage services should only be provided by practitioners]

7
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:14,934
[who are legally licensed and registered.]

8
00:00:14,955 --> 00:00:16,680
- Sign it.
- No, I won't.

9
00:00:16,726 --> 00:00:18,600
- I warned you about the steel.
- Let go of my son.

10
00:00:19,595 --> 00:00:21,760
You damn masseur. I’m coming for you.

11
00:00:25,683 --> 00:00:26,684
Mom!

12
00:00:28,883 --> 00:00:29,884
Flatfoot!

13
00:00:32,944 --> 00:00:33,745
Mom!

14
00:00:33,824 --> 00:00:35,840
I need both of you to come to the police station

15
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:37,200
for questioning in connection with a murder case.

16
00:00:37,232 --> 00:00:39,360
Police Colonel Krit.

17
00:00:39,595 --> 00:00:42,880
He killed my mother! He killed my brother!

18
00:00:44,387 --> 00:00:46,800
The Black Book says

19
00:00:46,904 --> 00:00:48,960
massage can be used to kill.

20
00:00:49,102 --> 00:00:51,000
Today marks the auspicious official launch

21
00:00:51,094 --> 00:00:52,961
of the อโรคยาแลนด์project.

22
00:00:53,095 --> 00:00:55,440
Dongyang, a Chinese businessman,

23
00:00:55,496 --> 00:00:58,520
has invested an enormous sum in this project.

24
00:00:58,582 --> 00:01:00,800
Moreover, we are joined by Master Tim,

25
00:01:00,883 --> 00:01:02,880
who is regarded as a grand master of traditional Thai massage.

26
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,120
My sole intention is to support our massage therapists

27
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:08,820
to join อโรคยาแลนด์.

28
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:12,360
Anyone wants to become a massage therapist,you’re welcome to apply.

29
00:01:12,405 --> 00:01:13,600
There’s no way it’s just a wellness center.

30
00:01:13,638 --> 00:01:15,480
Maybe he’ll only stop committing evil once he’s dead.

31
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:29,751
Shit!

32
00:03:52,176 --> 00:03:53,177
Hey!

33
00:03:54,712 --> 00:03:56,291
Panic? Are you having a panic attack?

34
00:03:57,939 --> 00:03:59,680
Calm down. Calm down.

35
00:04:01,315 --> 00:04:02,960
It’s okay. Just stay calm.

36
00:04:03,032 --> 00:04:04,958
Look at me. Look at me.

37
00:04:06,334 --> 00:04:07,335
Breathe in.

38
00:04:07,752 --> 00:04:08,753
Breathe out.

39
00:04:08,979 --> 00:04:09,980
Take deep breaths.

40
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,361
In.

41
00:04:11,678 --> 00:04:12,679
Out.

42
00:04:13,385 --> 00:04:14,386
In.

43
00:04:14,883 --> 00:04:15,884
Out.

44
00:04:19,603 --> 00:04:20,604
Just stay calm, okay?

45
00:04:30,819 --> 00:04:31,820
Are you okay?

46
00:06:01,568 --> 00:06:02,569
How was it?

47
00:06:05,814 --> 00:06:07,440
There was an accident, so I missed him.

48
00:06:08,499 --> 00:06:09,800
I’ll take care of it tonight.

49
00:06:12,590 --> 00:06:14,091
He’s already flown to Shanghai.

50
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,280
I’m sorry, Dad.

51
00:06:48,184 --> 00:06:51,294
Arokaya Land is holding massage therapist tryouts tomorrow.

52
00:06:51,422 --> 00:06:52,423
Interested?

53
00:06:52,523 --> 00:06:54,324
[Now hiring a large number of Thai massage therapists]

54
00:07:03,118 --> 00:07:04,125
I’m coming for you,

55
00:07:04,390 --> 00:07:05,391
Dongyang.

56
00:07:27,850 --> 00:07:29,551
[Now hiring a large number of Thai massage therapists]

57
00:08:24,182 --> 00:08:25,183
What did your boss say?

58
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,061
She didn't know about it.

59
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:30,161
She can't find out about it. I am taking a day off today.

60
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:32,441
Thanks

61
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:35,080
for pushing me to take that Thai traditional medicine assistant course.

62
00:08:35,750 --> 00:08:38,440
Otherwise, I wouldn’t even be eligible to apply to work with Master Tim.

63
00:08:39,963 --> 00:08:43,120
My insider says the pay is really good.

64
00:08:43,246 --> 00:08:44,960
Even without guaranteed pay, I’d still take the job.

65
00:09:19,848 --> 00:09:20,849
Sit down.

66
00:09:32,486 --> 00:09:34,087
Master Tim will personally test your massage skills.

67
00:09:34,427 --> 00:09:35,428
Once everyone has completed the test,

68
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,200
the results will be announced together.

69
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:41,701
With this many applicants, who knows when the testing will finish?

70
00:09:44,536 --> 00:09:46,600
Wrist pulse point.

71
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:48,600
Palm point.

72
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:50,456
Everyone heard that, right?

73
00:09:50,915 --> 00:09:52,200
First row, please come forward.

74
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:54,250
Next row, follow closely and keep the line moving.

75
00:10:03,832 --> 00:10:04,833
Go.

76
00:10:21,616 --> 00:10:22,617
Enough.

77
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,721
This might hurt a little, Master.

78
00:10:59,462 --> 00:11:00,560
May I?

79
00:11:29,912 --> 00:11:31,420
Are your hands too stiff to greet your elders?

80
00:11:39,296 --> 00:11:40,297
May I?

81
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:02,560
How calm must his mind be for his pulse to be this faint?

82
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,850
You’re not allowed to touch above the wrist.

83
00:12:32,547 --> 00:12:33,548
It’s okay.

84
00:12:35,982 --> 00:12:37,300
Are you the new generation of Thai massage therapists?

85
00:13:05,230 --> 00:13:06,360
Don’t you want a Chaleo?

86
00:13:22,715 --> 00:13:23,716
Do we have more?

87
00:13:24,334 --> 00:13:25,440
She was the last one.

88
00:13:27,904 --> 00:13:29,905
Hello!

89
00:13:31,163 --> 00:13:33,320
Hello, everyone!

90
00:13:38,788 --> 00:13:41,840
I’m the majority shareholder here.

91
00:13:42,640 --> 00:13:45,240
I invested in this place with Master Tim

92
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:48,321
because I love massages.

93
00:13:49,571 --> 00:13:52,720
But I only get massages from therapists at Arokaya.

94
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:58,600
Therapists personally handpicked by Master Tim.

95
00:14:00,340 --> 00:14:02,641
Anyone who gives me a massage I like

96
00:14:03,304 --> 00:14:04,520
will be rich.

97
00:14:04,987 --> 00:14:05,988
Rich.

98
00:14:06,139 --> 00:14:07,140
Rich!

99
00:14:09,238 --> 00:14:10,640
- Do you want to be rich?
- Yes, sir.

100
00:14:11,239 --> 00:14:12,240
Do you want it?

101
00:14:12,699 --> 00:14:14,050
Do you want to be rich? Give me your hand.

102
00:14:14,088 --> 00:14:15,089
Do you want to be rich?

103
00:14:15,390 --> 00:14:16,520
Do you?

104
00:14:16,675 --> 00:14:17,676
Give me your hand. Rich!

105
00:14:17,776 --> 00:14:20,480
Rich, rich, rich!

106
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:22,280
Rich!

107
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:45,361
Rich, rich, rich!

108
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:47,440
RICH!

109
00:14:51,358 --> 00:14:53,000
Those who received a Chaleo have passed.

110
00:14:53,918 --> 00:14:55,580
Our staff will escort you to Human Resources.

111
00:14:56,054 --> 00:14:57,760
Everyone else may leave. Thank you.

112
00:15:02,187 --> 00:15:03,820
Why didn’t they just tell us we failed?

113
00:15:04,278 --> 00:15:05,939
They made us wait and waste our time.

114
00:15:07,011 --> 00:15:08,760
The signal point is only as wide as a matchstick,

115
00:15:10,126 --> 00:15:11,760
yet you have the nerve to apply as a therapist here.

116
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:20,200
Anyone who received a Chaleo with a broken spoke

117
00:15:23,678 --> 00:15:24,679
has failed the test.

118
00:15:33,067 --> 00:15:34,068
How come?

119
00:15:48,550 --> 00:15:49,936
Master Tim! Master Tim!

120
00:15:53,878 --> 00:15:54,879
What is it?

121
00:15:56,784 --> 00:15:58,560
I’d like to know the judging criteria.

122
00:16:00,123 --> 00:16:01,124
Muk.

123
00:16:02,784 --> 00:16:03,785
Give us a minute.

124
00:16:15,885 --> 00:16:17,886
You’re not suited to work as a therapist here.

125
00:16:18,248 --> 00:16:20,136
But you said you wanted to work with a new generation of therapists.

126
00:16:20,149 --> 00:16:21,150
That’s right.

127
00:16:21,845 --> 00:16:23,520
Then aren’t you choosing us based on our skills?

128
00:16:27,107 --> 00:16:28,170
The younger generation…

129
00:16:30,990 --> 00:16:32,091
So confident.

130
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:38,600
Your shoulders are tense.

131
00:16:40,963 --> 00:16:42,680
Stiff and stressed.

132
00:16:43,047 --> 00:16:44,320
It’s like you’re carrying a heavy burden.

133
00:16:46,206 --> 00:16:47,207
Trust me.

134
00:16:47,552 --> 00:16:48,760
You’re not suited to this place.

135
00:16:50,262 --> 00:16:51,763
But I really want to work here.

136
00:16:52,598 --> 00:16:53,850
Could you test my massage skills again?

137
00:16:54,838 --> 00:16:56,250
Just tell me exactly how you want it.

138
00:16:56,270 --> 00:16:57,360
Firmer or gentler—I can adjust it for you.

139
00:17:06,104 --> 00:17:07,105
All right.

140
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:16,241
[WARNING: The massage techniques depicted in this series are entirely fictional.]

141
00:17:16,250 --> 00:17:18,251
[Do not attempt to imitate them.]

142
00:18:15,238 --> 00:18:16,239
Impatient.

143
00:18:17,558 --> 00:18:18,600
Your cup is already full.

144
00:18:20,427 --> 00:18:21,528
Do you know the answer now?

145
00:18:55,251 --> 00:18:56,760
I heard you

146
00:18:57,683 --> 00:19:00,000
tell that girl

147
00:19:00,171 --> 00:19:01,450
that her cup was already full.

148
00:19:04,278 --> 00:19:05,600
What does that mean?

149
00:19:07,435 --> 00:19:09,100
She’s too eager to show off what she’s learned.

150
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:23,081
Go straight to the room.

151
00:19:24,616 --> 00:19:25,617
Yes, Master.

152
00:19:25,870 --> 00:19:27,250
You sure took your time answering.

153
00:21:15,182 --> 00:21:16,560
Hey, kiddo.

154
00:21:17,183 --> 00:21:19,100
I told you to stay put. You’ll only get hurt again.

155
00:21:19,800 --> 00:21:20,801
Are you okay?

156
00:21:34,878 --> 00:21:37,920
Good thing you could still speak and ask someone to call me to pick you up.

157
00:21:39,838 --> 00:21:41,439
It’s only your first day, and they’ve already hurt you this badly.

158
00:21:42,810 --> 00:21:44,711
I don’t think you should get involved with them anymore.

159
00:21:48,179 --> 00:21:49,680
The plai smells so nice, Wan.

160
00:21:52,024 --> 00:21:53,180
Don’t change the subject.

161
00:21:53,560 --> 00:21:56,254
Both Dongyang and Master Tim are dangerous. Don’t risk it.

162
00:21:58,680 --> 00:22:01,134
If I want to get close to them, I have to do it through massage.

163
00:22:13,347 --> 00:22:14,348
Does it hurt a lot?

164
00:22:15,262 --> 00:22:17,000
Your breath smells like that of someone who’s sick.

165
00:22:21,624 --> 00:22:22,625
Something’s blocked.

166
00:22:23,822 --> 00:22:24,823
I can’t fix it.

167
00:22:26,110 --> 00:22:27,111
I feel...

168
00:22:28,111 --> 00:22:29,400
a sudden wave of heat.

169
00:22:31,139 --> 00:22:32,820
I’ve never met anyone capable of doing something like this.

170
00:22:34,174 --> 00:22:35,175
Master Tim.

171
00:22:35,763 --> 00:22:36,960
Now I believe he really is that good.

172
00:22:39,700 --> 00:22:40,701
Ask Uncle Korn.

173
00:22:41,726 --> 00:22:42,767
Then he will find out about it.

174
00:22:43,247 --> 00:22:45,450
Oh, don’t act like you’ve never lied before.

175
00:22:55,166 --> 00:22:56,280
That’s enough, Dad.

176
00:22:59,411 --> 00:23:00,412
Who did this to you?

177
00:23:00,787 --> 00:23:02,560
It was just a minor accident, Dad.

178
00:23:02,640 --> 00:23:03,641
You’re lying.

179
00:23:04,080 --> 00:23:05,681
Those are the effects of pressure applied below the collarbone.

180
00:23:06,608 --> 00:23:08,140
This wasn’t an accident.

181
00:23:13,360 --> 00:23:14,361
Hello, Uncle.

182
00:23:15,131 --> 00:23:17,300
Did you receive the medicine I sent you?

183
00:23:18,256 --> 00:23:19,520
What happened to her, Wan?

184
00:23:20,304 --> 00:23:21,745
Uh, she fell off her motorcycle.

185
00:23:22,528 --> 00:23:24,560
I have another call coming in. I have to go.

186
00:23:24,683 --> 00:23:25,684
Goodbye.

187
00:23:28,998 --> 00:23:30,040
Stop it.

188
00:23:30,107 --> 00:23:32,315
If your dad finds out, we will both be in trouble.

189
00:23:39,384 --> 00:23:41,300
By the time Dad finds out, I’ll probably have succeeded already.

190
00:23:42,250 --> 00:23:43,360
Succeeded at what?

191
00:23:45,248 --> 00:23:46,249
Hey, kiddo.

192
00:23:46,982 --> 00:23:48,000
What are you trying to accomplish?

193
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:22,760
Calm down. Calm down.

194
00:24:22,907 --> 00:24:24,808
Look at me. Look at me.

195
00:24:26,190 --> 00:24:27,191
Breathe in.

196
00:24:27,736 --> 00:24:28,737
Breathe out.

197
00:24:28,808 --> 00:24:29,809
Take deep breaths.

198
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:31,161
In.

199
00:24:31,571 --> 00:24:32,572
Out.

200
00:24:33,176 --> 00:24:34,177
In.

201
00:24:34,760 --> 00:24:35,761
Out.

202
00:25:14,792 --> 00:25:16,200
Come here, come on.

203
00:25:17,358 --> 00:25:18,359
Hurry.

204
00:25:19,182 --> 00:25:20,360
Hello.

205
00:25:20,648 --> 00:25:22,080
You need to sit first. Sit.

206
00:25:22,462 --> 00:25:24,240
Are you hungry? Are you hungry?

207
00:25:25,112 --> 00:25:26,440
Come on, sit.

208
00:25:27,011 --> 00:25:29,240
You must be hungry. Here.

209
00:25:29,795 --> 00:25:30,796
Is it good?

210
00:25:32,040 --> 00:25:33,041
You want more?

211
00:26:06,651 --> 00:26:07,652
Hello.

212
00:26:13,774 --> 00:26:15,000
One of the medicines is out of stock.

213
00:26:15,075 --> 00:26:17,100
I’ve already ordered it, but it hasn’t been delivered yet.

214
00:26:17,518 --> 00:26:19,019
When will the next shipment arrive?

215
00:26:19,768 --> 00:26:21,360
Actually, it only just sold out.

216
00:26:21,854 --> 00:26:23,450
That customer bought the last of it.

217
00:26:29,550 --> 00:26:30,551
Breathe in.

218
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:32,001
Breathe out.

219
00:26:32,100 --> 00:26:33,101
Take deep breaths.

220
00:26:44,603 --> 00:26:46,560
Hey, what are you doing?

221
00:26:47,227 --> 00:26:48,251
Let me return the favor and help you.

222
00:26:48,384 --> 00:26:49,385
What are you going to do?

223
00:26:49,700 --> 00:26:51,720
Let her massage you. She’s good at locating the pressure lines.

224
00:26:51,750 --> 00:26:52,751
She’s a massage therapist.

225
00:27:06,798 --> 00:27:07,799
You have flat feet?

226
00:27:08,797 --> 00:27:09,798
Yeah.

227
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:18,001
The flatfooted bastard.

228
00:27:19,050 --> 00:27:20,200
You’re that flatfooted bastard.

229
00:27:51,560 --> 00:27:53,000
You need to loosen up your muscles

230
00:27:53,043 --> 00:27:54,360
to improve your circulation.

231
00:28:40,968 --> 00:28:41,969
Does that feel better?

232
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:46,801
You need to become more in tune with your body.

233
00:28:46,850 --> 00:28:48,351
Then it’ll tell you what’s wrong.

234
00:28:50,147 --> 00:28:51,148
Thank you.

235
00:28:56,718 --> 00:28:58,250
I never do a favor without expecting something in return.

236
00:29:08,030 --> 00:29:09,600
That’s all the medicine. Everything’s here.

237
00:29:10,031 --> 00:29:11,320
How much is his?

238
00:29:12,220 --> 00:29:13,280
The return you were hoping for.

239
00:29:15,459 --> 00:29:16,460
Thank you.

240
00:29:19,526 --> 00:29:21,300
Flat feet like yours are very rare.

241
00:29:21,750 --> 00:29:23,542
Have you ever met anyone else with feet like yours?

242
00:29:24,299 --> 00:29:25,300
No.

243
00:29:32,395 --> 00:29:33,500
Consider us even.

244
00:29:39,592 --> 00:29:41,100
Phat’s always like that.

245
00:29:42,659 --> 00:29:43,660
His name is Phat?

246
00:29:45,534 --> 00:29:47,320
He didn't even say goodbye before leaving.

247
00:29:47,443 --> 00:29:48,445
Thank you.

248
00:30:41,491 --> 00:30:42,880
If cannabis can be legalized,

249
00:30:42,909 --> 00:30:44,500
why can’t casinos be legalized too?

250
00:30:45,176 --> 00:30:47,760
Go get a law passed for me.

251
00:30:48,486 --> 00:30:49,840
There’s a lot of opposition.

252
00:30:50,144 --> 00:30:51,660
I think it’ll be difficult this time.

253
00:30:51,900 --> 00:30:53,800
The other side doesn’t agree with us either.

254
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:56,441
Name your price.

255
00:30:58,672 --> 00:30:59,880
As for the general public,

256
00:31:00,318 --> 00:31:02,560
I’ll have someone come up with a catchy slogan

257
00:31:02,819 --> 00:31:05,420
and spin it to make the idea sound cool. They’ll soon support it.

258
00:31:09,411 --> 00:31:12,320
This country loves freedom, after all.

259
00:31:12,558 --> 00:31:14,365
Come on. Let’s celebrate in advance.

260
00:31:56,742 --> 00:31:57,960
Are you stealing from me?

261
00:32:08,822 --> 00:32:10,440
Hey, no!

262
00:32:44,650 --> 00:32:46,800
Mr. Chukiat, leader of the Thai Thamrong Party,

263
00:32:46,851 --> 00:32:48,160
one of the opposition coalition parties,

264
00:32:48,288 --> 00:32:52,054
has invited Mr. Krit, a former upright police officer

265
00:32:52,189 --> 00:32:55,920
who resigned from a promising career in public service

266
00:32:56,038 --> 00:32:58,600
because he could no longer tolerate the patronage system,

267
00:32:58,726 --> 00:33:01,700
to serve on the ad hoc committee

268
00:33:01,720 --> 00:33:04,763
studying ways to promote the creative economy.

269
00:33:04,960 --> 00:33:08,200
The committee will focus on scrutinizing the high-profile,

270
00:33:08,261 --> 00:33:09,950
Arokaya Land project.

271
00:33:10,147 --> 00:33:11,448
Initially,

272
00:33:11,840 --> 00:33:15,000
I’ll summon the Cabinet ministers

273
00:33:15,688 --> 00:33:19,136
responsible for overseeing this matter

274
00:33:19,328 --> 00:33:21,920
